# tier-coverage.inv — cull any candidate missing the confidence-tier contract.
#
# Mirrors auto-evolve-ab.sh validity check 3b: at least one tier("…") /
# repo_tier("…", call AND the three tier literals "propose" / "review-gated"
# / "autonomous" must appear in the source text. Source-shape field
# `tier_coverage_ok` (payload v2, agentis-core #938) is that raw-text
# grep-semantics check. A boolean field takes a bare boolean literal and
# only ==/!=.
class = inviolable
when tier_coverage_ok == false
